{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119681","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119681/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119681/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119681/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119681","id":4506494273,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7eiepe","number":119681,"title":"Fix Curve point count expansion preserving points","user":{"login":"emanueledenaro","id":79084923,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDg0OTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79084923?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro","html_url":"https://github.com/emanueledenaro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","color":"ff7766","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-05-23T02:05:11Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T08:44:21Z","closed_at":"2026-09-22T08:43:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119681","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119681","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119681.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119681.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes #119660\n\nWhen the Inspector adds a new point to a `Curve`, it stores the current indexed point properties, increases `point_count`, then reapplies those properties. `Curve::set_point_count()` was using `_add_point(Vector2())` for the newly-created slot. Since `_add_point()` keeps points sorted by offset, adding a default `(0, 0)` point could shift existing indexed points before the Inspector restored their values, making the first point appear reset.\n\nThis changes `Curve::set_point_count()` to create new points at the end of the curve domain when expanding an existing curve. That keeps existing indexed slots stable while still using `_add_point()` for point initialization, sorting, tangent updates, and dirty-state handling.\n\nAI-assisted contribution: AI tooling was used for issue triage, implementation drafting, and local test orchestration.\n\nTests:\n- `scons platform=macos target=editor tests=yes vulkan=no angle=no accesskit=no ccflags=-fmodules-cache-path=/private/tmp/godot-clang-module-cache -j4`\n- `HOME=/private/tmp/godot-test-home ./bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --headless --test --test-case=\"[Curve] Expanding point count should preserve existing indexed point properties\"`\n- `HOME=/private/tmp/godot-test-home ./bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --headless --test --test-case=\"[Curve]*\"`\n- `HOME=/private/tmp/godot-test-home ./bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --headless --test --test-case=\"[Curve2D]*\" --test-case=\"[Curve3D]*\"`\n- `/private/tmp/godot-prek-venv/bin/prek run --show-diff-on-failure --files scene/resources/curve.cpp tests/scene/test_curve.cpp`\n- `git diff --check`\n\n## Additional information\n\nThe test mirrors the Inspector's property replay sequence: read indexed point properties, expand `point_count`, then set the old indexed properties back. It also checks that the existing indexed positions are preserved immediately after expanding.\n","closed_by":{"login":"emanueledenaro","id":79084923,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDg0OTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79084923?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro","html_url":"https://github.com/emanueledenaro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emanueledenaro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119681/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119681/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}